 "summary": "Lochinvar's ProtoNode FPC-N54 start-up guide maps the Knight FTXL boiler's Modbus registers to 46 BACnet objects (Appendix C.6). Four BVs carry room and tank thermostat demands, BIs give safety switch, flame, pump and relay states, AIs give temperatures, firing rate, pump speeds and the status, blocking and lockout codes, and eight AVs take the Modbus board command and BMS-supplied sensor values.",
