  "summary": "Call for heat with the Room Thermostat 1 BV (and Tank Thermostat for DHW), or use the 0-10 Volt Input/Rate Cmd/SP Cmd AV for a rate or setpoint. Read boiler status, outlet temperature, firing rate, flame, alarm contacts and the lockout code.",
