  "enable": "BV 1-3 (Room Thermostat 1-3) and BV 4 (Tank Thermostat) are the demand commands; AV 39 Configuration, AV 40 Coils and AV 41 0-10 Volt Input/Rate Cmd/SP Cmd are the Modbus board command registers. The guide does not give the command sequence.",
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": "AV 43-46 (tank, outdoor, system supply and return temperature) are writable so the BMS can supply those values; the guide does not say when they are used.",
  "setup": [
   "ProtoNode FPC-N54 to the boiler: Modbus RTU, 9600 baud, no parity, 8 data bits, 2 stop bits (IPW: 19200 baud, 1 stop bit).",
   "Give each unit a unique Node-ID (1-255). BACnet device instance = Node_Offset (default 50,000) + Node-ID.",
   "BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP is chosen in the ProtoNode web configurator."
  ],
